{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-26T06:15:11.228Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"00cec8b639eabc53332f98bc","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-26T06:15:11.228Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11.228Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"The pinned SDK exposes no PmClient disposal or pending-worker drain API. Its supported foreground search refresh mode makes awaited SDK mutations finish their work before fixture teardown; annotation subprocesses are synchronous and return after child completion. Add a managed fixture for explicitly owned asynchronous child close, watcher close and pending tasks, followed by fs.promises.rm with recursive/force/maxRetries. Real native ENOTEMPTY injection must pass with retries and fail when the retry option alone is reverted; retain persistent errors. PR 150 will say Fixes #151. Ambient agent-session failures were separately reproduced and will be fixed in the next commit without weakening provenance assertions."}]}],"before_hash":"81b5972555fa2d0759af44f4e8b9d004a566f59251b6a19858f2a41564e4206a","after_hash":"a729769b111b82e9afa4a27a17f922b94b2086d6ab8372497287daf4392a8218","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8b3bb8eb733d6eecad859e681485bc7e131d31c2ad6b81ef9d0e78ebc0c2dc8f"}
